  data: {
    LLM: "Conserve your highest-ranking pairs (like the Heaven or Earth pairs) for the later tricks. The game is won or lost on the final tile.\n\nWatch the discards carefully to determine which Military tiles (the 'singles') are still in play. Since there is only one of each Military tile rank, knowing what has fallen is critical to knowing if your tile is the current 'boss'.\n\nMaster the 'Supreme Pair' (Gee Joon) logic. The 1-2 and 2-4 tiles are the weakest individually but the strongest together as a pair. Using them correctly to break up an opponent's high pair lead is the mark of an expert.",
